# Articles API

# Group Articles

## Article [/articles/{id}]

+ Parameters
    + id: 8c6e... (string, required) - Article UUID.

### Retrieve Article [GET]

+ Meta
    + OperationId: getArticle
    + Tags: Articles, Public
    + Deprecated: false
    + Docs: https://docs.example.com/getArticle
    + Security: BearerAuth
    + Idempotent: true

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body

            {"id":"8c6e","title":"hi"}

